<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>烟雨江湖 · 本地存档工具</title>
    <meta name="description" content="烟雨江湖本地存档导入、导出工具与模拟器入口">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="./home.css?v=2.1.6">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@400;600;700;900&family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
    <main class="home-shell">
        <header class="home-header">
            <div class="home-title-row">
                <h1>观星模拟器</h1>
                <span id="appVersion" class="home-version"></span>
            </div>
            <p>夜观天象，手握星辰，推演江湖万象。</p>
        </header>

        <section class="home-grid" aria-label="存档与工具">
            <section class="home-panel archive-import-panel">
                <div class="panel-heading">
                    <div>
                        <h2>数据导入</h2>
                    </div>
                    <strong id="homeSaveStatus" class="status-badge">未导入</strong>
                </div>
                <div class="home-main-role"><span>主角</span><strong id="homeMainRole">—</strong></div>
                <label class="save-version-label" for="saveFormatVersion">解析版本
                    <select id="saveFormatVersion" class="save-version-select">
                        <option value="2.1" selected>2.1（当前）</option>
                        <option value="2.0">2.0（仅解析）</option>
                        <option value="1.9">1.9（仅解析）</option>
                        <option value="1.8.3">1.8.3（仅解析）</option>
                        <option value="1.8">1.8（仅解析）</option>
                    </select>
                </label>
                <div class="home-actions">
                    <label class="btn btn-primary">
                        <span class="import-txt">导入数据</span>
                        <input type="file" id="saveFileInput" hidden>
                    </label>
                    <button id="btnResetWebsite" class="btn btn-secondary" type="button">重置网页状态</button>
                </div>
                <p id="homeImportMessage" class="home-message" role="status">此工具是一个数据模拟器，不涉及任何数据传输，不会更改任何文件。</p>
            </section>

            <section class="home-panel exporter-panel">
                <div class="panel-heading">
                    <div>
                        <h2>导出工具</h2>
                    </div>
                    <strong id="saveExporterVersion">v2.1.2</strong>
                </div>
                <p id="saveVersionHint">支持解析版本 v2.1 的只读加密 .yanyu 文件（默认）</p>
                <p>TG交流群：yanyu_utils</p>
            </section>

        </section>

        <section class="home-panel module-panel" aria-labelledby="moduleTitle">
            <div class="panel-heading">
                <div>
                    <h2 id="moduleTitle">选择板块</h2>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="module-grid">
                <a href="./wash/index.html" class="module-card"><strong>洗髓模拟</strong><span>洗脉、锁脉、保底与置换推演</span></a>
                <a href="./equip/index.html" class="module-card"><strong>装备模拟</strong><span>打造、升炼、精炼与淬炼</span></a>
                <a href="./role/index.html" class="module-card"><strong>角色面板</strong><span>查看角色、天赋、装备和属性</span></a>
                <a href="./auto/index.html" class="module-card"><strong>自动模拟</strong><span>自动洗脉路线与装备批量预测</span></a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="home-panel changelog-panel" aria-labelledby="changelogTitle">

            <div class="changelog-header">
                <span class="changelog-kicker">版本动态</span>
                <h2 id="changelogTitle">更新日志</h2>
            </div>
            <section class="changelog-entry is-current">
                <div class="changelog-meta">
                    <h3>v2.1.7</h3>
                    <time datetime="2026-08-16">2026-08-19</time>
                </div>
                <ul>
                    <li>修正剑王阁序列不准确的问题。(测试版本)</li>
                    <li>适配国际服洗脉规则。</li>
                    <li>新增剑王阁以当前剑胚进旭后续剑胚推算的功能。(测试版本)</li>
                    <li>新增劍王閣自動模擬功能。(测试版本)</li>
                </ul>
            </section>
            <section class="changelog-entry">
                <div class="changelog-meta">
                    <h3>v2.1.6</h3>
                    <time datetime="2026-08-16">2026-08-1</time>
                </div>
                <ul>
                    <li>用着不是很顺手，再改改功能，勿念。</li>
                    <li>调整页面布局，保持界面整洁。</li>
                    <li>新增剑王阁序列查询。(测试版本)</li>
                    <li>调整自动洗脉的算法逻辑。(测试版本)</li>
                    <li>优化自动锻造的界面展示。</li>
                    <li>解决芒晶序列不准的问题。</li>
                    <li>调整手动洗脉序列不是很准确的问题。（未测试）</li>
                    <li>接入另一位余佬的无限制换页面。(界面还未优化)</li>
                    <li>感谢久，金两位道友的帮助测试。</li>
                </ul>
            </section>
            <section class="changelog-entry">
                <div class="changelog-meta">
                    <h3>v2.1.4</h3>
                    <time datetime="2026-08-15">2026-08-15</time>
                </div>
                <ul>
                    <li>更新自动模拟</li>
                    <li>修复页签丢失</li>
                    <li>导出工具优化 Mac 平台</li>
                </ul>
            </section>
            <section class="changelog-entry">
                <div class="changelog-meta">
                    <h3>v2.1.3</h3>
                    <time datetime="2026-08-14">2026-08-14</time>
                </div>
                <ul>
                    <li>修复自动模拟精炼误差</li>
                    <li>调整附加状态</li>
                    <li>兼容 v1.8 和 v1.8.3 存档的导入</li>
                </ul>
            </section>
            <section class="changelog-entry">
                <div class="changelog-meta">
                    <h3>v2.1.2</h3>
                    <time datetime="2026-08-14">2026-08-14</time>
                </div>
                <ul>
                    <li>新增自动模拟板块（测试版），模拟数据可能有误差</li>
                </ul>
            </section>
            <section class="changelog-entry">
                <div class="changelog-meta">
                    <h3>v2.1.1</h3>
                    <time datetime="2026-08-14">2026-08-14</time>
                </div>
                <ul>
                    <li>修正装备推进结果显示与重置清空模拟背包</li>
                    <li>校正含特殊材料打造装备的精炼种子</li>
                    <li>优化紫脉推演弹窗的内外层滚动</li>
                </ul>
            </section>
            <section class="changelog-entry">
                <div class="changelog-meta">
                    <h3>v2.1.0</h3>
                    <time datetime="2026-08-14">2026-08-14</time>
                </div>
                <ul>
                    <li>发布十五渠道存档导入与导出，新增魅族支持</li>
                    <li>优化 APK 渠道选择、操作步骤与免责声明界面</li>
                    <li>校正装备打造和洗脉网页逻辑</li>
                </ul>
            </section>
            <section class="changelog-entry">
                <div class="changelog-meta">
                    <h3>v2.0</h3>
                    <time datetime="2026-08-13">2026-08-13</time>
                </div>
                <ul>
                    <li>新增渠道感知的文件名与解析路由</li>
                    <li>扩展渠道支持并保留 1.9 兼容入口</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

        </section>

        <footer class="app-footer">
            <p>数据来源于 <a href="https://wiki.biligame.com/yanyu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">烟雨江湖 Wiki</a></p>
        </footer>
    </main>
    <script src="./shared/version.js"></script>
    <script src="./shared/pako.min.js"></script>
    <script src="./shared/sql-wasm.js"></script>
    <script src="./shared/sql-wasm-embed.js"></script>
    <script src="./shared/save_decrypt.js"></script>
    <script src="./shared/archive_state.js"></script>
    <script src="./home.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
